@startuml
!define USE_CUSTOM_THEME
!include ../../config/style.puml
' ============================================================
' 📄 File: error_flow_across_layers.puml
' 🧱 Layer: Cross-Layer Visualization (Domain → Infra → App → UI)
' 🎯 Purpose: Show error flow and dependency direction
' 🧑 Author: Mohamed Ali
' 🗓️ Created: 2025-10-21
' ============================================================

FA6_CUBE(DOMAIN_ERROR, "P1_DomainError", component, #D97A2B)
FA6_LAYER_GROUP(DOMAIN_RESULT, "P1_DomainResult<T>", component, #E5C55F)
FA6_BUG(RUNTIME_ERROR, "P1_Error", component, #E2C22F)
FA6_GEAR(LOGGER, "P1_Logger", component, #C8E26F)
FA6_BELL(NOTIFIER, "P1_Notifier", component, #C2C2C2)
FA6_DATABASE(FACTORY, "P1_S2_TaskRepositoryFactory", component, #4DA6FF)
FA6_WINDOWS(UI, "QML UI", component, #A0A0A0)

' ----------------------
' Relationships
' ----------------------
FACTORY --> RUNTIME_ERROR : creates runtime errors
FACTORY --> LOGGER : logs infra/runtime failures
FACTORY --> NOTIFIER : triggers fallback message
RUNTIME_ERROR --> DOMAIN_ERROR : converts to domain-safe
DOMAIN_RESULT --> DOMAIN_ERROR : wraps domain error
LOGGER --> RUNTIME_ERROR : logs type + context
NOTIFIER --> RUNTIME_ERROR : displays fallback message
UI --> NOTIFIER : receives toast / alert messages

' ----------------------
' Notes
' ----------------------
note top of DOMAIN_ERROR
  🧱 Pure Domain Error (no Qt deps)
  Used in: Entities, UseCases
  Originates from Domain logic (validation, storage)
end note

note top of RUNTIME_ERROR
  ⚙️ Runtime / Infra-level Error
  Used in: Logger, Notifier, Factories
  Can be converted to DomainError::Storage
end note

note top of FACTORY
  🗄️ Responsible for switching Postgres → InMemory
  Uses Logger + Notifier to handle failures
end note

@enduml
